  "id": "uo-igry",
  "title": "UO · Games and Puzzles",
  "description": "<p>Interactive puzzles and tavern dice games that the whole table plays together: the GM lays a puzzle out, the players solve it and everyone sees every move at once. Eleven puzzles — combination lock, sequence, mosaic, gates, constellation, map of paths, halls of mirrors, prisms and slabs, a device with a torn manual, ciphers — and three dice games with bot opponents, stakes and loaded dice. English and Russian.</p><p>Интерактивные загадки и настольные игры за одним столом: ведущий выкладывает, игроки решают, все видят одно и то же.</p>",
